# SA4E-335 DEF-001: the `test` stage COPYs tests/ and .env.test (Dockerfile
# L127-128) — re-include exactly those so `docker build --target test` works.
# Last matching pattern wins, so the negations must follow the exclusions.
# Everything else (.env, .env.production, *.md, *.log) stays excluded.
!tests
!.env.test
# SEC-01: credentials never enter the build context (nor any image layer).
